      "html": "† I. <big><big>[<span dir=\"rtl\">חָטַב</span>]</big></big>  <strong>verbo: cortar ou ajuntar madeira</strong>, geralmente <em>lenha</em> <strong>(</strong>hebraico pós-bíblico <em>idem;</em> árabe <span dir=\"rtl\">حَطَبٌ</span> <em>lenha</em>, <span dir=\"rtl\">حَطَبَ</span> <em>recolher lenha</em> (ver Wetzst em De <a data-ref=\"Psalms 144:12\" href=\"/Psalms.144.12\">ψ 144:12</a>); etíope ሐጠበ <em>cortar</em> (ou ajuntar) <em>lenha</em><strong>)</strong>—<br><strong>Qal</strong>  Imperfeito <span dir=\"rtl\">יַחְטְבוּ</span> <a data-ref=\"Ezekiel 39:10\" href=\"/Ezekiel.39.10\">Ez 39:10</a>; infinitivo <span dir=\"rtl\">לַחְטֹב</span> <a data-ref=\"Deuteronomy 19:5\" href=\"/Deuteronomy.19.5\">Dt 19:5</a>; particípio <span dir=\"rtl\">חֹטֵב</span> <a data-ref=\"Deuteronomy 29:10\" href=\"/Deuteronomy.29.10\">Dt 29:10</a>; plural <span dir=\"rtl\">חֹטְבִים</span> <a data-ref=\"II Chronicles 2:9\" href=\"/II_Chronicles.2.9\">2 Ch 2:9</a>; construto <span dir=\"rtl\">חֹטְבֵי</span> <a data-ref=\"Joshua 9:21\" href=\"/Joshua.9.21\">Jos 9:21</a> + 3 vezes; passivo plural feminino <span dir=\"rtl\">חֲטֻבוֹת</span> <a data-ref=\"Proverbs 7:16\" href=\"/Proverbs.7.16\">Pr 7:16</a>—<em>cortar ou ajuntar</em> madeira, seguido de acusativo <a data-ref=\"Deuteronomy 19:5\" href=\"/Deuteronomy.19.5\">Dt 19:5</a>; <a data-ref=\"Deuteronomy 29:10\" href=\"/Deuteronomy.29.10\">29:10</a> (‖ <span dir=\"rtl\">שׁאב מים</span>); cf. <a data-ref=\"Ezekiel 39:10\" href=\"/Ezekiel.39.10\">Ez 39:10</a> <span dir=\"rtl\">מן־היערים</span> (objeto na oração precedente); <a data-ref=\"II Chronicles 2:9\" href=\"/II_Chronicles.2.9\">2 Ch 2:9</a> (‖ <span dir=\"rtl\">כֹּרְתֵי הָעֵצִים</span>); particípio construto <span dir=\"rtl\">ח׳ עצים</span> <a data-ref=\"Jeremiah 46:22\" href=\"/Jeremiah.46.22\">Je 46:22</a>, e (‖ <span dir=\"rtl\">שֹׁאֲבֵי מַיִם</span>) <a data-ref=\"Joshua 9:21\" href=\"/Joshua.9.21\">Jos 9:21</a>, <a data-ref=\"Joshua 9:23\" href=\"/Joshua.9.23\">23</a>, <a data-ref=\"Joshua 9:27\" href=\"/Joshua.9.27\">27</a>.<br><strong>Pu.</strong>  Particípio <span dir=\"rtl\">מְחֻטָּבוֹת</span> <a data-ref=\"Psalms 144:12\" href=\"/Psalms.144.12\">ψ 144:12</a> sentido duvidoso; talvez <em>talhado</em> (assim, em essência, Thes MV SS Ew Che Bae; ver contudo <a data-ref=\"BDB, חטב\" href=\"/BDB,_חטב\", dir=\"rtl\">II. חטב</a>), de colunas angulares (<span dir=\"rtl\">זָוִיּוֹת</span> ver <a data-ref=\"BDB, זָוִית\" href=\"/BDB,_זָוִית\", dir=\"rtl\">זָוִית</a> p. 265 acima), símile de filhas formosas, majestosas.",
