      "preview": "יְחִיאֵל: nome próprio masculino: Jeiel.",
      "html": "† <big><span dir=\"rtl\">יְחִיאֵל</span></big>  <strong>nome próprio masculino. (</strong><em>viva Ēl;</em> fenício <span dir=\"rtl\">יחואלן</span>, <span dir=\"rtl\">יחומלך</span> ver Eut<sup> ZMG 1876, 136</sup><strong>)</strong>—𝔊 geralmente Ιειηλ, Ιαιηλ;—<br><strong>1.</strong>  um dos principais músicos de Davi <a data-ref=\"I Chronicles 15:18\" href=\"/I_Chronicles.15.18\">1 Ch 15:18</a> (𝔊 Ιειηλ, 𝔊L Ιαιηλ), v. <a data-ref=\"I Chronicles 15:20\" href=\"/I_Chronicles.15.20\">20</a> (𝔊 Ειθηλ, 𝔊L Ιειηλ), <a data-ref=\"I Chronicles 16:5\" href=\"/I_Chronicles.16.5\">16:5</a> (𝔊 Ειειηλ, 𝔊L Ιαιηλ).<br><strong>2.</strong>  um dos chefes dos levitas de Davi <a data-ref=\"I Chronicles 23:8\" href=\"/I_Chronicles.23.8\">1 Ch 23:8</a> (𝔊 Ι(ει)ηλ), <a data-ref=\"I Chronicles 29:8\" href=\"/I_Chronicles.29.8\">29:8</a> (𝔊 Βεσιηλ, A 𝔊L Ιειηλ).<br><strong>3.</strong>  tutor dos filhos de Davi <a data-ref=\"I Chronicles 27:32\" href=\"/I_Chronicles.27.32\">1 Ch 27:32</a> (𝔊 Ιε(ρι)ηλ, 𝔊L Ιωηλ).<br><strong>4.</strong>  filho de Josafá <a data-ref=\"II Chronicles 21:2\" href=\"/II_Chronicles.21.2\">2 Ch 21:2</a>.<br><strong>5.</strong>  <span dir=\"rtl\">יְחִו֯אֵל</span> hemanita do reinado de Ezequias <a data-ref=\"II Chronicles 29:14\" href=\"/II_Chronicles.29.14\">2 Ch 29:14</a>.<br><strong>6.</strong>  supervisor no reinado de Ezequias <a data-ref=\"II Chronicles 31:13\" href=\"/II_Chronicles.31.13\">2 Ch 31:13</a>.<br><strong>7.</strong>  dirigente do templo no reinado de Josias <a data-ref=\"II Chronicles 35:8\" href=\"/II_Chronicles.35.8\">2 Ch 35:8</a>.<br><strong>8.</strong>  contemporâneos de Esdras, <a data-ref=\"Ezra 8:9\" href=\"/Ezra.8.9\">Ezr 8:9</a> (𝔊 Ιεμα, A Ιεειηλ, 𝔊L Ιειηλ), <a data-ref=\"Ezra 10:2\" href=\"/Ezra.10.2\">10:2</a>, <a data-ref=\"Ezra 10:21\" href=\"/Ezra.10.21\">21</a>, <a data-ref=\"Ezra 10:6\" href=\"/Ezra.10.6\">6</a>.",
